            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.24

- Removes the dormant background `thread/resume` subscription path so menu status refreshes no longer wake Codex threads just to check state.
- Keeps recent thread and activity status refreshes on lightweight local desktop/session state, reducing idle CPU and MCP process pressure.
- Fixes stale waiting indicators and reduces retry polling pressure while keeping new activity discovery responsive.
]]></description>
